"entity": {
"name": "Capri Holdings Limited",
"description": "Capri Holdings Ltd. engages in the design and distribution of sportswear, accessories, footwear, and apparel of branded women's apparel, and men's apparel. The firm operates through the following segments: Versace, Jimmy Choo, and Michael Kors. The Versace segment sells Versace luxury ready-to-wear, accessories, footwear, and home furnishings through directly operated Versace boutiques. The Jimmy Choo segment refers to the sale of Jimmy Choo luxury goods to end clients through directly operated Jimmy Choo stores. The Michael Kors segment focuses on selling Michael Kors products through four primary Michael Kors retail store formats such as Collection, Lifestyle, outlet stores, and e-commerce. The company was founded by Michael David Kors on December 13, 2002 and is headquartered in London, the United Kingdom.",
"rbics_econ": "Consumer Cyclicals",
"rbics_sector": "Consumer Goods",
"rbics_subsector": "Apparel and Accessory Products",
"rbics_indgrp": "Multi-Type Apparel and Accessories Production",
